window.products.push({"id":710025,"name":"Patelai Thank You For Being My Stepmother, Mom Gifts for Mommy Stepmom on Mother's Day Birthday Christmas, 12 oz Stainless Steel Coffee Mug with Lid S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UdRHjFAqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  Tumbler set: Engraved with interesting sayings of [Thank You for being my bonus], [mom], [If I had a different bonus], [mom], [I would punch her in the face], this coffee mug is simple, funny and useful gift for mom or lady who is like-a-mom, which will show your appreciation for her, it is a warm present that will put a happy smile on her face.  Quality material: Made of 304 double-wall vacuum insulated stainless steel, it'll keep drinks cold or hot. Come with a clear lid ,which can keep your drink at the proper temperature. Anti-sweat and anti-condensation design keeps the outer wall of the cup cool and comfortable making it easy to hold.  Specifications: Material: 304 stainless steel Cup capacity: 12 oz Color: as picture shows  Package includes: 1 x Wine tumbler with lid 1 x Stainless steel straw 1 x Straw brush 1 x Gift Box  Warm notice: Wash it before first use. Daily washing, wash by hands gently, not in dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UdRHjFAqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patelai","source_asin":"B09VSH8B5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSH8B5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSH8B5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710026,"name":"KitchenAid Lemon Zester, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3124JK0XV8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Consider this a peeler that is dedicated to distinguish the multilayerd properties inherent in the peels of citrus fruits. For most recipes, when the zest is required, a standard peeler simply won't work. The Kirchen Aid Lemon Zester, however, has been engineered and design to swiftly perform this delicate function - with ease. Lemon Zest is the yellow part of the peel on the outside of a lemon. It has an intense lemon/citrus flavor with very little bitterness. The bitterness is primarily found in the white part of the lemon. When removing the skin from lemons or other citrus fruits, be sure to take only the thin outer zest or colored portion. A lemon zester allows one to remove the zest (and only the zest) in long strips. A zester has tiny cutting holes that create threadlike strips of peel. If you do not have a zester, use a vegetable peeler or a small, sharp knife. Amazon.com Put a little zest in your life with this nifty little gadget. With its sharp holes for zesting and built-in channel knife for fashioning pretty garnishes, it's the ultimate tool for making the best use of your citrus. The zester shaves off tiny slivers of citrus skin without getting at the bitter pith, adding the perfect tang to desserts, lemonade, baked goods, and brightly flavored sauces and salad dressings. The channel knife lets you create narrow spirals of citrus peel for garnishes or make decorative scoring marks along the outside of a cucumber or lemon. The hanging loop lets you keep this dual-purpose tool within arm's reach. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3124JK0XV8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00005KIAY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005KIAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005KIAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
