window.products.push({"id":710077,"name":"Cuba Map Caribbean Fridge Collector's Souvenir Magnet 2.5\" X 3.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Jw8hTwYAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Here's a brand new, rare and a hard to find collector's item: CUBA MAP CARIBBEAN FRIDGE COLLECTOR'S SOUVENIR MAGNET 2.5\" X 3.5\". These magnets are made of industrial strength vinyl and are neither flexible nor bendable. They are also water resistant but not waterproof and it's not advisable to keep them in water for prolonged periods of time. These magnets are standard and not 3D (tri-dimensional). Please note : these magnets MAY NOT stick to stainless steel appliances. So please check in advance whether or not the surface you are planning to use is \"magnet friendly\". These are all extremely rare and would make a wonderful addition to anyone's collection or make a great gift! Items will be shipped by USPS in bubble envelopes and will be packed securely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Jw8hTwYAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WBS","source_asin":"B07J6G2M57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J6G2M57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J6G2M57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710078,"name":"Bodum Stainless-Steel Fondue with Glass Insert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511SZTQDZXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Making fondue is as easy as enjoying it. Your Bodum fondue set will make for a stressfree gathering of friends and family as everybody is her or his own cook, so you can concentrate enjoying your guest. The gorgeous stainless steel fondue set comes with a glass insert for cheese and chocolate fondue, while the stainless steel pot is for meat and seafood fondue. The six fondue forks are numbered to prevent mix-ups. The fondue set requires the use of a special gelled fuel, sold separately. 1.5 Qts. Amazon.com Strikingly contemporary in design, this fondue set combines a shapely, satin-finish stainless-steel pot and a glass bowl insert to serve all forms of fondue: oil, broth, cheese, and chocolate. The pot holds 2 quarts or more of oil or broth for festively cooking meat, poultry, seafood, and vegetables. The glass bowl insert has stainless-steel handles to lower it into the pot partially filled with hot water to keep 1 quart or more of cheese or chocolate fondue melted. Neither the pot nor the glass bowl are stovetop-safe so oil or broth need to be brought to a simmer in another container on the stove. When partially immersed in simmering water, the glass bowl will melt chocolate, but cheese fondue is best prepared first on the stove. Six stainless-steel fondue forks and a fork holder that fits into the pot's top are included. Gel fuel is required, but not included. The pot stands 9-3/4 inches high on an 8-1/8-inch-diameter base. All parts are dishwasher-safe. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511SZTQDZXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B000B6PC2E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000B6PC2E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000B6PC2E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
