window.products.push({"id":710097,"name":"wedrink Cold Brew Coffee Maker, Glass Iced Coffee Maker Leak Proof Traitan Iced Tea Coffee Pitcher(44oz,1.3L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618l3028eaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ Taste The Difference: Making a chilled glass of barista-quality caffeinated goodness is easier than ever with the wedrink Cold Brew Coffee Maker. Make up to 8 cups of refreshingly smooth, rich cold brew concentrate that is naturally 65% less acidic than traditional hot coffee. Our unique stainless steel filter will work to maximize extraction and minimize any sediment or bitterness for the perfect brew tailored to your flavors. ☕ Excellent Quality Rest Assured To Use - Food-grade borosilicate glass coffee carafe can be filled with ice or hot water, providing a variety of possibilities for use, thickening quality, sturdiness, and long-term use. The big and strong handle saves you unnecessary worry when you making ice coffee. ☕ Food-Grade Removable Mesh Filter and No-Slip Base :Removable food-grade stainless steel filter keep out the grinds into your cold brew maker which will offer you best tasting experience. The bottom silicone loop keeps the glass pitcher more stability without slipping. ☕ ENJOY DIFFERENT COLD BREWS : Our cold brew tea maker comes with an ultra fine nylon, non-rusting and metal-free mesh. It helps extract from your coffees or your leaf teas aromatic oils and subtle flavors that you won't get from a traditional brew coffee, Enjoy a smooth & delicious cold brewer drinks at home such as, ice coffee, lattes, iced tea, fruit infusion & lemonade. ☕ PERFECT GIFT:A gift that will be used ! Cold brew coffee machine is perfect gift for coffee/tea lovers, housewarming parties, weddings, birthdays, and healthy gourmets!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618l3028eaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wedrink","source_asin":"B0B24BLXSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B24BLXSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B24BLXSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710098,"name":"KSA 7.25\" Polonaise Santa Claus with Gold Bell and Gifts Glass Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21dv5DhSVxL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Kurt Adler Polonaise collection is a spectacular array of glass ornaments made in the tradition of the age-old European craft of hand blown glass. Their Artisans have created designs that are reminiscent of the treasured glass ornaments of yesteryear. Each piece is carefully hand-blown in fine sculpted detail, silvered, lacquered and then hand painted in the most exquisite colors. The final results are beautiful works of art. We Believe each of these ornaments will become a treasured heirloom that will be handed down from generation to generation and will enchant your family's Christmas for many years to come. Polonaise ornaments are made for Kurt Adler by a number of fine glass studios ; Komoja and Art Glas to name just two. Kurt Adler seeks to offer you the best ornaments they can and each piece comes carefully packaged in the signature Polonaise box for safety as well as your yearly storage when it’s not on your tree. Polonaise ornaments are imitated but never equaled. Treat yourself or a friend to one this year.As of 2018 production of Polonaise branded ornaments has ceased","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21dv5DhSVxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KSA","source_asin":"B007TYGIVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007TYGIVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007TYGIVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710099,"name":"At Home Designs Top Grain Leather Recliner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ijxWxZj7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Tailored lines, smooth grained leather and appropriate dimensions for a moderately sized room presence. The Tisdale’s Cabernet wine color is easily coordinated into many room décors. With classy high leg construction, one may not suspect that this is actually an inviting push back recliner. The soft rolled arms, accented with French seams, have partially hidden decorative nail heads tracing the front curvature of each arm and also along the bottom edges. This recliner is completely covered in 100% leather. An overall medium firmness is soft, relaxing and yet supportive. The addition to your room is an expression of good taste and top of the line quality. The Tisdale is designed with sinuous wire seating and swing anchors for added seat comfort. The seat box is crafted with lumber for a more sturdy frame and extra seat life. Glued joints and corner blocks add to the solid frame construction. The attached seat cushion contains 30 pocketed coils covered with standard 1.8 density foam for greater resistance against sagging. The recliner backside has a moveable skirting which allows for removal of the chair back to facilitate transport through narrow doors and stairways. Trimmed underneath with a non-woven dust cover to conceal all exposed wood, every detail has been addressed to provide a finished look that is as handsome and stylish as it is functional. Seat: 21” W x 22” D x 20.5” H / Arm height: 20.5” H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ijxWxZj7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"At Home Designs","source_asin":"B01C55X0I6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C55X0I6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C55X0I6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
