window.products.push({"id":710255,"name":"Pkgd Plastic Medieval Vest Party Accessory (1 count) (1/Pkg)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ojlQu51XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beistle 66158 Packaged Plastic Medieval Vest. This plastic full sized medieval armor vest can be worn as a fun accessory to any medieval themed or costume party!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ojlQu51XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beistle","source_asin":"B003NT9YR0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003NT9YR0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003NT9YR0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710256,"name":"Sawyer's Mill Bears Will Kill You Dead. Handmade Wood Sign. Wire Hanger Also Serves as a Stand. UV Printed Reclaimed Maple Slats. 2.5x8 inches. Made i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDqzvBd8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing our newest decor piece for all the funny and adventurous campers out there! The perfect addition to any home, office, or mancave. The sign features the hilarious saying \"What Doesn't Kill You Makes You Stronger Except for Bears. Bears Will Kill You Dead.\" This sign is sure to get a smile from anyone who reads it! Men and Women and alike will love the fun and quirky saying. Handcrafted in Tennessee, this small handmade wood sign is about the size of a candy bar. Perfect for tight spaces in need of décor. Bathrooms, Cubicles and Home Offices are a perfect fit. It's big enough to make a statement, but small enough to fit in any room, whether it's a bedroom, kitchen, or den. The reclaimed wooden slats have natural edges and are rough-sawn, and sanded to create a vintage and shabby chic look that will complement any woodsy or mountain-themed decor. The black and white color scheme, along with the bear paw tracks graphics, add a rustic touch that will transport you to your favorite camping or hunting spot. This versatile sign comes with a wire hanger that allows it to be hung on a wall or door. But, if you prefer to display it on a desk or shelf, simply turn the hanger backwards to create a stand. This makes it perfect for decorating your RV, cabin, shed, or even your office! The message on the sign is UV printed and will last for years to come due to the durability of the inks. Overall, this sign would be a delightful and unique decoration or gift, perfect for adding a touch of natural charm to any space. Not only is this sign a great addition to your own collection of decorations and accessories, but it also makes a wonderful gift for family, friends, and coworkers. Whether you're a fan of skiing, fishing, hiking, or just relaxing by the lake, our sign is the perfect way to show off your love for the outdoors. Order yours today! And remember, free hugs are available, but only for the non-bear variety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDqzvBd8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sawyer's Mill","source_asin":"B0B8F3JNBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8F3JNBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8F3JNBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
