window.products.push({"id":710303,"name":"Tribesigns 70.8” Corner Bookshelf, 8-Tier Industrial Bookcase with Metal Frame for Open Storage, Corner Display Rack Storage Organizer for Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816lGBO-esS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Corner Bookshelf：Combining the industrial look of steel with the warmth of wood, this shelving has a clean, contemporary design; Corner design greatly increases storage space, its multiple shelving giving versatile decorating options. This bookshelf's industrial-chic looks match an array of modern furniture and you can mix and match to create your perfect room. 8-Tier Open Shelf: Unlike normal bookshelves, ours has double storage spaces that give you plenty of room to display your well-thumbed classics or a few of your favorite pottery pieces from the shop down the street. Each shelf dimension in 39.3”L x 11.8”W, can easily hold books of any size, framed photos, hardback books, and other office essentials. Reliable Construction: Constructed of E1 particleboard for a solid structure and supported by heavy-duty metal frame for reliable use, each shelf could hold 110 lbs. supplemented by adjustable leg pads, this bookcase can firmly stand on uneven ground. Space Saving & Versatility:The 90° right-angle design perfectly fits the corner of your room and doesn’t occupy too much floor space, make full use of the limit corner space. Used as a book shelf, plant stand and display shelf, this this multi-use storage solution works as a bookcase in the home office or a display console anywhere you please. Installation & Care Tips: In order to save your time, please follow the step-by-step instruction to assemble. All necessary hardware included. For the long-term use of the product, please not to expose it outdoors and wipe with a damp cloth for daily cleaning. Feel free to let us know if you have any questions about this bookcase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816lGBO-esS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B0BLCPC59N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCPC59N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCPC59N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
