window.products.push({"id":710409,"name":"250g / 8oz / ½lb Kraft Paper Stand Up Coffee Bag Pouch. Round Bottom, Zip Lock, Degassing Valve and Heat Seal-able. Pack of 10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZT5mBGdzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coffee beans’ greatest enemies are air, moisture, heat, and light. To preserve your beans’ fresh roasted flavor and taste of your coffee, store them in an opaque, air-tight container at room temperature. Keep your beans in a dark and cool location. Avoid places that are too warm. Our Kraft Paper Stand Up Coffee Bag is ideal to keep your home roasted coffee fresh, keep in small pack, share with friends or preserve your bulk purchases frozen with this high barrier gusset stand up pouches. The one-way valve lets excess air get squeezed out, but doesn't allow it back in. Keeping air and moisture out to prolong your dried food. The thick foil and LLDPE layers provide UV protection for keeping everything fresh. Even your darkest oily roasts won't soak through these bags. Heat seal the flaps for a professional look. Accessible with a side tamper proof zipper. This bag is attractive, retail-friendly gusset stand up design can be embellished with personalized logos and labels. Product Detail: NAME : EverPack Kraft Paper Round Bottom Stand Up Coffee Pouch Bag FEATURES : Round bottom gusset stand up design with high quality one-way degassing valve for your coffee freshness. The one-way valve lets excess air and moisture get squeezed out, but doesn't allow it back in. Top heal sealable flaps. MATERIAL :Nature Kraft Paper, Aluminum foil fused protective inner lining, LLDPE SIZE : . 10 pcs of Kraft stand up paper pouch bag. 6.3 x 9.6 x 3.9 inches or 160 x 245 x 100 mm (Width x Height x Round Bottom Gusset). Suitable for 250g / 8oz / ½lb coffee bean or coffee grounds. QUANTITY : 10 pcs NOTE : Heat sealer (not included) is required to seal the paper bag flaps.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZT5mBGdzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EverPack","source_asin":"B07GZK8P3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZK8P3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZK8P3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710410,"name":"ROSMARUS PU Kitchen Rug 18\"x30\", Anti Fatigue Floor Mat Non Slip Waterproof Cushioned Standing Kitchen Mat for for Home,Office,Sink,Laundry (18\"x30\", ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717mKFhZi5L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"About Products Size: 18x30 inch  Fabric: Premium PU Leather Occasion: kitchen, sink, office, laundry Why Choose ROSMARUS Kitchen Mats? Durable & Non Slip backing Give support and comfort  Waterproof & Stain Resistant Unique and exquisite print pattern design Anti Fatigue & Relief of foot pressure Easy wipe clean with damp cloth Suitable for most floor types Add a stylish design for your home Package Includes: 1 Kitchen Rug Note 1. Please keep on a dry surface when 2. If the mat is wet, please fully dry it before use, and avoid direct sunlight","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717mKFhZi5L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSMARUS","source_asin":"B07Y6YYD7R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y6YYD7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y6YYD7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710411,"name":"Strathwood Griffen All-Weather Wicker Chaise Lounge, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A+SnWeMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com All-weather reclining chaise lounge chair for a porch, patio, deck, or other outdoor space. view larger Powder-coated aluminum frame covered in natural-colored, tightly woven, resin wicker. view larger Coordinates with other pieces from the Griffen collection (sold separately). view larger Removable beige-colored cushion in 100-percent polyester fabric. view larger Strathwood Griffen All-Weather Wicker Chaise Lounge Chair Time to Kick Back and Relax The Strathwood Griffen collection helps transform any porch, patio, or back deck into a welcoming place to visit with friends or to simply enjoy a bit of tranquility. As part of the Griffen collection, this outdoor chaise lounge chair gracefully combines purposeful panache with high-quality comfort. Whether placed pool side, on the patio, or out in the garden under a shady tree, the chaise lounge chair's contemporary style and bold profile make it a luscious addition to any outdoor furniture collection. Lightweight, Durable Design The all-weather chaise lounge chair features a durable yet lightweight powder-coated aluminum frame covered in woven, resin wicker with a light, sandy-colored natural hue. Supporting legs raise the lounge chair up off the ground, while a reclining mechanism offers five adjustable positions, plus completely flat for a total of six positions. Lower the chair so it's completely flat when soaking up the sun, or raise it up at an angle when sipping cocktails or relaxing after a swim. Cushion Included For enhanced comfort, the chaise lounge chair also comes with a custom-fit cushion. The cushion features 100-percent polyester fabric in a soft beige color with piping along the edges for a neatly tailored look. Coordinates with Surrounding Decor Tastefully designed to blend with almost any decor, the all-weather chaise lounge chair can be used on its own, with existing outdoor furniture pieces, or as part of the coordinating Griffen furniture collection from Strathwood (dining and lounge pieces sold separately). The all-weather wicker chaise lounge chair measures 77.6 inches long by 28.3 inches deep by 36.2 inches high and weighs 34.2 pounds. Cushion Care and Cleaning: Gently brush off dirt before it becomes embedded in the fabric and wipe up any spills as soon as they occur. Gently spot clean only with mild soap and cool water using a sponge or soft brush, then air dry the cushion in a sunny location. Both the chair and the cushion should be brought indoors or securely covered during inclement weather and stored in a dry place when not in use. Please note that upholstered items purchased on different occasions over time may have a slight variation in hue. This is normally expected between rolls of like fabric, since no two can be produced to come out exactly the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A+SnWeMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Strathwood by Amazon.com","source_asin":"B00A72GJAQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A72GJAQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A72GJAQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710412,"name":"OXO Good Grips Silicone Collapsible Strainer, 2 Quart,Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Df1lKJU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Colanders are so useful in the kitchen - for straining pasta, rinsing beans, and so much more - but storing them can be a pain, especially if you have limited cabinet space. The collapsible colanders fix that problem - the holes are spaced for quick straining, and the silicone folds up for flat, compact storage. Plus, the silicone makes the colander extra easy to clean, and heat-resistant to make it safe for pasta right from the pot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Df1lKJU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B0741G8SSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0741G8SSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0741G8SSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
