window.products.push({"id":710485,"name":"Blancho Bedding [Modern Plaids] 3-Pieces Floral Printed-Quilted Cotton Quilt Set (King Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817q+I2zA0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Set includes a quilt and two quilted shams (one in twin set). Shell and fill are made of cotton. For convenience, all bedding components are machine washable on cold in the gentle cycle and can be dried on low heat and will last you years. This [Modern Plaids] quilt set will refresh your bedroom decor instantly, create a cozy and inviting atmosphere and is sure to transform the look of your bedroom or guest room. Dimensions:Full/Queen quilt: 90 inches x 98 inches; Standard sham: 20 inches x 26 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817q+I2zA0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blancho Quilt","source_asin":"B00DW1OLP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DW1OLP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DW1OLP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710486,"name":"Woven Rectangle Seagrass Basket Set for Home - 4 Decorative Storage Baskets for Bathroom Organizing and Storage - Eco-Friendly Nesting Baskets with Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fW8PElXDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Capture clutter with class With the Birch + Ash Woven Basket Set you can store, organize and display more of your belongings safely and attractively. These cute baskets for organizing come in 3 different sizes so they hold an array of items from TV remotes and reading material to toiletries, towels and lap blankets or are perfect as shelf baskets for storage. Wherever you need to arrange and store things neatly and discreetly, these versatile baskets are up to the task. Set them atop a coffee table, use them in the bathroom or arrange them on a bookshelf for visual impact. A world of possibilities With 4 roomy baskets, they suit a wide variety of home storage and organization needs including bathroom organization. Baskets measure 6.5\" x 4.5\" x 3\"; 11\" x 7\" x 4\"; and 13\" x 9\" x 5\". These multi-purpose, decorative storage baskets are sturdy and rigid so they can hold weighty books, kitchen cutlery, rolled lap blankets and other items without losing their shape. When not in use, the 2 small baskets nest inside of the medium basket, which then nests inside the large basket for space-saving storage. Handcrafted by Bangladeshi artisans These rectangular baskets are fashioned from natural seagrass, one of the most abundant and sustainable resources on Earth. They have been meticulously formed to ensure stable, flat bottoms that will rest atop an ottoman, nightstand, dresser or countertop. Birch + Ash Woven Baskets are easy to maintain by simply wiping them off with a damp cloth periodically. A complimentary cotton dust bag keeps them clean and safe. For a simple yet stylish solution to household clutter, add a set of Birch + Ash Woven Seagrass Baskets for organizing to your cart today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fW8PElXDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Birch + Ash","source_asin":"B07SFTKSPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SFTKSPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SFTKSPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
