window.products.push({"id":710536,"name":"Carltina Stylish Waffle Couch Cover for 3 Cushion Couch High Stretch Jacquard Sofa Cover Thickened Sofa Slipcover Furniture Protector with Elastic Bot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VHcX1wThL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"EXCLUSIVE DESIGN: ENJOY THIS EYE-CATCHING COUCH COVER WITH LATEST WAFFLE PATTERN! This stretchy sofa cover is made from a polyester-spandex jacquard fabric that boasts three-dimensional, attractive waffle pattern, more chic and rich in texture, which makes even the oldest of couches look years younger. In addition, this thick sofa slipcover has a smooth soft feel, breathable and durable, maintaining quality standards. PERFECT FIT: The high elastic couch covers for sofa are super flexible due to its 95% polyester and 5% spandex fabric, so it can fit most couches. But please measure your furniture from arm to arm according to our measuring guide. Small size for chairs is width up to 30-47 inch, Medium size for loveseat is width up to 56-70 inch, Large size for sofa cover is width up to 71-92 inch, X-Large sizes for oversized sofa cover is width up to 93-115 inch. SOFA PROTECTOR: A must-have for homes with children and pets. This magic couch cover not only hides the imperfections of your furniture which has been chewed on by the dog or worn down over time, but also gives your favorite old sofa a new, rejuvenated look instead of buying a completely new one or protects your new sofa from daily wear and tear, dust, stains and pet scratches and pet fur. You can brush off pet fur without effort. STAY IN PLACE: This sofa slipcover comes in one piece, wrapping around every part of your sofa and hugging the sofa’s curves by elastic bands. The cover also comes with foam inserts for quick and precise fitting. So this couch slipcover is slip-resistant and strapless, ensuring a better fit and less movement of the cover with repeated use. EASY INSTALLTION: Easy to put on and off, just tuck the extra fabric into the gap between the back and sitting area to get refresh visual effects.Machine washable for easy care and maintenance. Gentle cycle and tumble dry low. We promise that our sofa covers are made from the great quality materials. If you are not 100% satisfied, just contact us and we will solve it for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VHcX1wThL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carltina","source_asin":"B08DRCZSHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DRCZSHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DRCZSHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710537,"name":"Enameled Cast Iron Dutch/French Oven, 4.5-Quart Round Dutch Oven with Self Basting Lid & Stainless Steel Knob, Electric Gas Stove Top Compatible Cookw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-XfMjMi+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-layer Porcelain Enamel Finish over Interior & Exterior】: Are you still concerned about food getting stuck to the bottom? ►The cast iron dutch oven’s matte black enameled interior is as smooth as the exterior and it can build up a non-stick “seasoning” over time that won’t rust or discolor with use. ►The porcelain enamel finish over the exterior is beautiful, long-lasting and eliminates the need to season the cookware. 【Tasty Dishes in Self-basting System】: This multi-purpose cast iron cooking pot/cocotte features a special under-lid drop structure that helps seal in moisture and distribute condensation evenly over the food, keeping meat and fish succulent and tender. ►Roomiest loop side handles provide a secure grip, easy transfer from stove top to table even when wearing oven mitts. ►Solid food grade stainless steel knob that is extremely durable and oven safe up to 500 degrees F. 【Unparalleled in Heat Retention and Even Heating】: Better heat retention of the cast iron will actually reduce the amount of energy needed for cooking so it saves money. This round enameled cast iron dutch oven has 4.5 qt capacity, which is the perfect choice for preparing slow-cooked soups, stews, and sauces, baking breads and casseroles and much more. 【Versatile for most cooktops & Easy Cleaning】: The cast iron pot can be used on gas, electric, induction cooktops, as well as in the oven.►Not for use in microwave and not dishwasher safe. The cast iron French oven also allows you to cook, marinate, serve, and store food without needing a separate container, impacting flavors or absorbing odor. ►Hand washing with warm soapy water is recommended to preserve the cookware's original appearance. 【1 Year Warranty & Best Customer Service】: All dutch ovens PROVIDE 1-year WARRANTY. If you have any problem before or after ordering, please feel free to contact us via Q&A or email. We guarantee to provide our customers with top quality service and ensure best shopping experience as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-XfMjMi+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIIG","source_asin":"B07PBDQ7PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PBDQ7PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PBDQ7PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
