window.products.push({"id":710565,"name":"HORLIMER 18 Pack Food Storage Containers Set, BPA-Free Plastic Meal Prep Freezer Container with Lids, Stackable and Reusable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uls2n4KxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD GRADE MATERIAL: HORLIMER food container is made of BPA-free and food-grade plastic, which is safe to contact foods directly. And sturdy material structure ensures the long life of the container. 36-PIECE FOOD STORAGE CONTAINERS SET: Package includes assorted sizes of 18 storage containers with 18 lids, 4 big containers with 64 oz(1900 ml), 6 medium containers with 21 oz(650 ml), 8 small containers with 6 oz(180 ml). Different sizes of lunch box can cover your storage needs well. SPACE SAVING: Practical nestable design is easy to store when not in use and maximizes your space. Great for meal prep, leftovers, cupboards, freezers, refrigerators, pantry, and kitchen organization. KEEP FRESH AND SAFE: There is a wide opening between lids and containers that could be covered or removed easily. They can store and transport food safely. So these reusable food containers can create an airtight space to keep food fresh and protect your food from spilling, moisture and more. EASY CLEANING: Plastic meal prep containers have a smooth edge. Hand wash is better to protect the snack containers that not easy to break or deform.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uls2n4KxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HORLIMER","source_asin":"B095JS15HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095JS15HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095JS15HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710566,"name":"Veronese Design Bronze Finish Plato Statue Philosophy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T8RZtgRTL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Plato is one of the most dazzling writers in the Western literary tradition and one of the most penetrating, wide-ranging, and influential authors in the history of philosophy. An Athenian citizen of high status, he displays in his works his absorption in the political events and intellectual movements of his time, but the questions he raises are so profound and the strategies he uses for tackling them so richly suggestive and provocative that educated readers of nearly every period have in some way been influenced by him, and in practically every age there have been philosophers who count themselves Platonists in some important respects. This beautiful cold-cast resin statue of Plato features a wonderful metallic bronze finish and has hand-painted accents to show off the detail. A pensive Plato is shown holding a book on The Republic, contemplating the problems of society. The base that Socrates stands on features Socratic quotes on all sides. The statue measures 11 3/4 inches tall, 4 1/8 inches wide, and 3 1/2 inches deep. It makes a great gift for deep-thinkers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T8RZtgRTL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veronese Design","source_asin":"B007N5N6V0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007N5N6V0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007N5N6V0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
