window.products.push({"id":710576,"name":"WHW Whole House Worlds Tribeca Magazine Holder Racks, Set of 2, Lush Gray Faux Suede, Top Handle, Silver Buckles and, Stitched Details, 18 and 15 3/4 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o1LaiFcTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHOW OFF YOUR READING MATERIAL in luxurious style! Treasure your favorite magazines with our Tribeca Faux Suede Magazine Holders. SOLD AS A SET OF 2, they are designed with a graciously arched top handle and silver buckle, plus the lush gray leather grained exteriors are beautifully detailed and the interiors lined with soft gray fabric. BEAUTIFULLY PROPORTIONED each of the well sized pieces in the set of 2, measure as follows: 18 L x 7 W x 16 ½ H and 15 3/4 L x 6 3/4 W x 15 H inches. CLUTTER BUSTERS These smart magazine holders are ideal everyday use and helping keep living rooms clear of clutter. Suited for both contemporary, urban, and rustic settings, these versatile magazine holders are ideally placed beside a seating arrangement or nestled by a coffee table to stow away things you need close at hand like tv remotes, chargers, keys and more. When not doing duty in the living room, bring them into other areas of the home where they can help organize daily items such as rolled towels in the bathroom. Great gifts, these are ideal presents for those who love to read, and stay organized. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o1LaiFcTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B073H9RRH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073H9RRH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073H9RRH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710577,"name":"Bowron Single PELT RUG 24\"x36\" (DARK BROWN)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pFoHoVDGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Authentic Bowron select lambs from the finest flocks from the vast sheep stations of Australia's outback, the high country runs and the lush green pastoral farms of New Zealand. Browron operates tanneries in New Zealand and Australia, which are conveniently placed in the midst of prime sheep farming areas, ensuring a plentiful source of high quality raw material. To this day, every Bowron Sheepskin is the perfect result of the same methods pioneered in the 1880's by the Bowron brothers from Yorkshire. Their unique 42 step tanning method has been constantly refined over the past 100 years. The raw skins are still expertly trimmed, machined and hand washed before the tanning commences. The tanned fleece is dried, combed by machine then by hand and finally polished to enhance the natural luster of the Sheeps wool. Only then is the Bowron symbol of excellence attached to the Sheepskin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pFoHoVDGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bowron","source_asin":"B001OY5XMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001OY5XMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001OY5XMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
