window.products.push({"id":710581,"name":"OurWarm Mexican Serape Table Runner, Upgraded Mexican Blanket Fiesta Table Runner with 3D Pom Pom Trims for Mexican Theme Party Wedding Decorations Fi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vfKpiev0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"◆COMMON SIZE: Our mexican table decorations measure 14 x 84in, It can be used for dining table decoration for 4-6 people. The sarape table runner is is perfect decorations for Mexican theme party wedding for the reception to bring a nice and festive feel to your dining area ◆NEW VERSION: The fiesta table runner is handwoven. Pure and bright color with classic Mexican falsa blankets stripes pattern, as well as tassels and cute pom pom trims embellishment which had sewn on the two sides. It's fine workmanship and the thread is not easy to get loosened ◆SUPERIOR MATERIAL: The Colorful Mexican blanket table runner is made of 100% natural premium durable cotton, which is soft than other fabric and easy to clean, lightweight, soft skin-friendly, no color ran, no smell, and light steam iron as need. It can be used year after year ◆ MULTI FUNCTION: Mexican party table runner can be used as table cloth, shawl and scarf, picnic rugs, wall tapestry, also ideal for coffee table, dressing table, chair, bench, sofa, bedspread decorations and just anything you must cover. It is portable with a suitable size and lightweight ◆VARIOUS OCCASIONS: This Mexican stripe table runner is perfect for Mexican wedding party, Mexican bridal shower, Mexican birthday party, Fiesta party, Taco party, Carnival Party, Cinco de Mayo celebration, Tribal party, Dia De Los Muertos decorations, Day of the dead decorations, etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vfKpiev0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OurWarm","source_asin":"B082YP54BP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082YP54BP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082YP54BP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710582,"name":"It’s A Girl Baby Shower Banner and Decorations Kit | Pink Gold with Extra Long Gold Glitter Twine for Easy Hanging | Cardstock Flags Gender Reveal Chr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LDiOg4s7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Planning a baby shower or a gender reveal party? This 'It's a Girl' baby shower decoration kit is exactly what you need! It’s perfect for celebrating any mom-to-be with a little girl on the way. Eliminate the stress surrounding party planning with the ‘It’s a Girl’ banner that comes in this kit. The banner is made from high-quality pink and gold cardstock with a metallic gold touch for a classy, chic feel. Each letter is printed on its own light pink flag that measures between 4 inches and 5.5 inches. All of the flags come pre-strung with 8-foot glittery gold twine that allows for multiple use and inventive hanging. The kit also comes with 6 hot pink tassels that can be strung up with your sign or strung together to make another banner. We’ve also included 2 light pink tissue paper honeycomb pom poms and 9 large paper fans. Just add some flowers and balloons and you’ll be good to go. This kit is ideal for throwing your bestie’s baby shower. Help her celebrate this exciting time! You can even use this kit at a gender reveal or pregnancy announcement party. Make a cute wall display and hide it behind a blanket. Tear down the blanket to reveal the exciting news to your loved ones! Whether you’re using this kit for a party or photoshoot, you’ll have the decorating essentials to make the party a success. From bridal sashes and veils to wall decor, CC Party Co. has you covered. Make your party Instagram worthy by using our chic decorations. Hey girl, let’s party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LDiOg4s7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CC Party Co.","source_asin":"B07B3T5YTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B3T5YTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B3T5YTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710583,"name":"MyGift 2 Piece Modern Wall Mounted Brass Metal Umbrella Rack, Tall and Short Umbrella Holder Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hoNPLyk9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize your umbrellas in style with this brass tone metal wall mounted 2 piece umbrella storage rack. Holds up to 4 smaller umbrellas and 2 long ones, each fitting into their own brass framed square cubby, helping to keep them upright and securely stored. With two separate rails you can easily mount them onto most flat wall surfaces and adjust the height and space between them to accommodate your specific needs. Smaller cubbies on the top and bottom rails are perfect for housing shorter umbrellas. The edged bottom trays help keep any water from dripping onto your floors from wet umbrellas while also keeping them from slipping out. Bring contemporary style and function to your entryway, mudroom, office, or retail space with this wall mounted 2 piece umbrella storage rack with brass tone metal frame. Approximate Dimensions: Top Rail Overall - 12.0 L x 3.1 W x 5.9 H; Bottom Rail Overall - 12.0 L x 3.1 W x 5.5 H; Each Cubby - 2.6 L x 2.6 W (in inches)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hoNPLyk9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyGift","source_asin":"B09GKYSCFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GKYSCFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GKYSCFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710584,"name":"Dance of the Winter Solstice by The Macneil Studio, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dDBDlK70L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a woman in a white dress striking a ballet pose. Richard macneil, a self taught artist, formed the macneil studio in 2009 with his wife Judy and their sons Daniel and Kyle. Born in Winchester, macneil started his working life as an artist at Worcester royal porcelain and has always worked in the fields of sculpture, ceramics, and illustration, both in the UK and internationally. He spent many years living on the East coast of the USA, then returned to Worcestershire and freelanced as an artist and greeting card designer. Richard spends any spare time he has with his family walking in the beautiful British countryside and fishing. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dDBDlK70L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B071YDP814","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071YDP814","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071YDP814","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
