window.products.push({"id":710666,"name":"Castevia Complete EcoSet Polished Steel Paella Pan 15-Inch 38cm up to 8 servings + Paella Gas Burner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ZT1eeMpkL._AC_.jpg","description":"Includes: Stand Set Eco Set by Castevia Imports. Polished Steel Paella Pan 15-Inch 38cm up to 8 servings + Gas Burner + Squared Tripod support legs. This is a great way to cook authentic paella on your deck or back yard. Perfect for parties! (Made in Spain) Propane gas ONLY *Propane and Gas Regulator is not Part of this KIT and are NOT INCLUDED. BEFORE FIRST USE: Boil water in the recipient, then rinse it with soap and water. Avoid scratches or bumps. Another method is to cook a small amount of onion on the pan, then boil it with the water. When water starts to boil, remove water and wash thoroughly. PRECAUTIONS DURING USE: Never apply heat to an empty recipient. Avoid overheating or abrupt changes in temperature. Avoid all types of marks and scratches. Never use in a microwave. During its use, all parts will be HOT. Use heat protection at all times while use, keep away from children. MAINTENANCE: Clean the recipient with water and detergent. Once clean, dry immediately. Do not let it air dry. Use a clean paper towel to apply oil to both sides of the pan, this avoids rust. Even though this stainless steel recipient is very delicate, it continues to be a highly used product for the authentic Valencian kitchen. . STORAGE: After applying the oil, cover the recipient in paper towels and then insert the covered recipient into a plastic bag. Store in a vertical position in a dry place. PRECAUTION: Never apply heat to an empty recipient or at extremely high temperatures. Use moderate temperatures. To cook only use interior burners. When adding water to the recipient, you may use both burner rings. We are not responsible for mishandling of the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ZT1eeMpkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vaello by Castevia Imports","source_asin":"B07894NJW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07894NJW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07894NJW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
