window.products.push({"id":710727,"name":"Mardatt 6 Sets White Ceiling Hanging Hook with Chains Swag Hook Kit, 1.5 Inch Swag Hooks with Hardware and 36 Inch Extension Chains for Hanging Plants","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UahYu8k+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mardatt 6 Sets White Ceiling Hanging Hook with Chains Swag Hook Kit, 1.5 Inch Swag Hooks with Hardware and 36 Inch Extension Chains 📌Product Specification-- Product: Swag Hooks And Chains With Mounting Hardware-- Material: Steel -- Surface: White Enamel Finish -- Swag Hooks Size: 55mm x 41mm / 2.16\" x 1.61\" -- Toggle Bolt: 68mm / 2.68\" -- Pointed Screw: 36.7mm / 1.44\" -- Spring Toggle Wings: 50mm / 1.97\"-- White Chain: 91.8cm / 36.1\" 📌Why Shall You Choose “Mardatt”? ✿ High-quality steel construction will easily support the weight up to 25 lb on solid walls, and 15 lb on hollow walls. ✿ Includes 2 common used types of fasteners to help you get started with your installation right away. ✿ With white enamel finish, not just having a elegant, sculptural look but easily match with any surrounding. ✿ Suitable for a wide variety of decor, like plant, wind chimes, bird feeder, baskets, lanterns, ect. 📌Installation Method:●  For Hollow Wall/Ceiling: Use an electric drill to make a hole that the spring toggle wing can be folded into and through it without the need to remove the toggle bolt, then let the wing automatically opened behind the hollow substrate, attach the swag hook until it is snug. So the swag hook is securely anchored.●  For Solid Wall/Ceiling: Use an electric drill to make a hole according to the size of pointed screw, then attach the hanger bolt to the swag hook and turn it clockwise until it is snug. 📌Package Includes:✿6 x Swag Hooks✿6 x Toggle Bolts✿6 x Toggle Wings✿6 x Pointed Screws ✿2 x Chains - Oval Shape ♥♥Warm Tips: -Please see the 2nd picture for size details. -These are pointed items, please always keep away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UahYu8k+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mardatt","source_asin":"B093H3DLHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093H3DLHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093H3DLHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
