window.products.push({"id":710773,"name":"Animals Sitting On The Moon Christmas Tree Wood Hanging Pendant for Outdoor Decorations, Window Wall Hanging Ornament Living Room Decoration Home Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ft2ybGY8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😺【Creative Christmas Decorations】The Wood Animals Sitting On The Moon Ornament is perfect memorable gift for your family and friends on soon Christmas! Hanging this unique ornament on your Christmas tree or sending to families and friends as a holiday gift, arrange a Christmas night for you and your family, it will be a perfect way to create loving memories. ⛄【High-quality & Double-printed】The Christmas tree decorations are printed through high heat sublimation process, bright colors and double-printed, with realistic patterns and fine workmanship. Each decoration is equipped with ropes, making it easier to hang. Fun and cute wood animals decorations fit the christmas theme, and add the festive atmosphere. 🎅【Size】Different styles of Christmas ornaments have different sizes for each piece. The size are shown in the picture.Most is About 8.5X8.5CM/3.3x3.3in.The right size makes Christmas ornaments more perfect. ❄【Widely used】The Christmas ornaments are easier to hang on the Christmas tree, doors and windows. It is very suitable for winter Christmas themed parties, Christmas tree decorations and New Year party decoration. You can also use them as Christmas gift tags and the best Christmas gifts to your family or friends. It can also be used as a car rearview mirror pendant. 🎅【Risk Free Shopping】With our full money-back guarantee you can shopping with peace of mind,if the products damage on transition or don't fit you style, free to contact our suppor team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ft2ybGY8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IncreDecor","source_asin":"B09LGYFQ3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LGYFQ3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LGYFQ3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710774,"name":"Yoshihiro Mizu Yaki Blue High Carbon Steel #1 Kurouchi Petty Japanese Utility Knife Shitan Handle (6'' (150mm) & No Saya)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WxVy-UxIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Knife Features → Blade Material: Blue Steel #1  →Edge Angle: Double Edged  →Grade: Mizu Yaki Kurouchi  →Handle Shape: Octagonal  →Handle Material: Rosewood  →HRC:63-64  →Knife Style: Petty Utility Knife  →Saya Cover: Optional Lacquered Magnolia Saya Knife Cover  →Stain Resistant: No  Our handmade Yoshihiro Mizu Yaki Kurouchi Series are unparalleled in their performance. Mizu Yaki is a meticulous process of pure water quenching that draws out the hardness of refined steel while infusing it with enough resiliency to perform consistently in the most exacting of conditions. The Black Forged 'Kurouchi' finish consists of the carbonized coating created during heat treating and provides for a characteristic look and a rustic aesthetic to the blade.Sometimes called a utility knife, the Petty is a smaller version of a chefs knife but is bigger than a Paring knife. The Petty fits in small places that require more dexterity than bigger chefs knives while handling bigger jobs than a Paring knife can take care of. Proudly made in Japan and not mass produced. This knife is complimented with a traditional Japanese Wa-style handcrafted Octagonal Handle that is lightweight and ergonomically welds to the hand for seamless use. An optional and recommended protective wooden sheath called a Saya can be purchased together, which protects the knife and adds to its appearance when not in use. Traditional Japanese knife making values a sharp edge, which requires attention and care. Sharpening and honing should be done with only water whetstones. Hand wash and dry only, and do so immediately if working with acidic ingredients. Do not use on objects such as bones, nutshells, and frozen foods. Carbon steel can oxidize if not properly maintained. Keep dry and oil regularly to prevent oxidation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WxVy-UxIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoshihiro","source_asin":"B07X27RLVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X27RLVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X27RLVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
