window.products.push({"id":710786,"name":"Spiker Two Pack 8 Inch Pink and Teal Beach Drink Sand Coaster Made in the USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j8-+Um2uL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Set these handy Spiker Beverage Holders in the sand next to your beach towel or chair. Add a cold drink, music player, phone, suntan oil, sunglasses, anything you want to keep off the hot sand. Spiker keeps your items cooler, sand-free and spill-free! Just toss into your beach bag and go! Set of 2 spikers, one pink and one teal. Each spiker measures 8\" high x 4\"wide x 3\"deep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j8-+Um2uL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Religious Gifts","source_asin":"B00I10SPNA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I10SPNA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I10SPNA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710787,"name":"Garlic Press Garlic Mincer & Crusher Stainless Steel Garlic Press Set for Kitchen with Brush & Peeler, Kitchen for Garlic, Garlic Presser Easy to Clea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s0GbqdyCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧄 EASY TO USE：This garlic press stainless steel with easy handle is ergonomic. Put one or two cloves of peeled or unpeeled garlic into the removable basket with small holes at the bottom, then position the anvil on the top of the garlic and press the handle. Very soon, the mashed garlic will come out from the small holes. This easy squeeze garlic press is designed for both men and women. Press by one hand is also no big deal for girls as well. Wow, just so easy and quick! 🧄 EASY TO CLEAN：After using the stainless steel garlic press & mincer & crusher, take out the removable basket to wash and rinse the handle. It is easy to get it cleaned in seconds. With the help of the small brush included in the garlic press set, the cleaning job will be easier and quicker. One more thing, it is also dishwasher safe! 🧄HIGH QUALITY & STURDY：This rust free garlic press & mincer & crusher for kitchen is made of premium stainless steel and zinc alloy. It is not easy to get rust or blemished. It is also very heavy and sturdy. Believe me, it will worth your money! 🧄TIME SAVING：Compared with chopping, this professional stainless steel garlic press & mincer & crusher will save you a lot of time and energy in preparing a delicious dish. A helpful kitchen gadget will enable you to enjoy the happiness of cooking. A good cook deserves a good garlic mincer and this is your best & last garlic press! 🧄 LARGE CAPACITY & GOOD CUSTOMER SERVICE：This dishwasher-safe & rust free garlic press & mincer & crusher could hold at least 2 or 3 small or medium garlic cloves one time, meeting your large-capacity demand. No need to press garlic cloves for a thousand times with a small basket ever! Besides, if you have any problem with this easy-squeeze garlic press & mincer & crusher, please feel free to contact the support team. We will try our best to solve your problem as soon as possible. 🧄 SMART DESIGN FOR MULTIPLE CHOICES: We have 3 smart choices for you, a small garlic press with a removable basket (Small A), a small garlic press with a nondetachable basket (Small B), a medium garlic mincer with a longer handle & removable basket (Medium). All the 3 garlic presses have the same-size basket (1” wide and 1.3” high). You can also choose to buy a single garlic press or a set of garlic press including a garlic peeler & a cleaning brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s0GbqdyCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEUPROPRA","source_asin":"B0BR3P3JCX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR3P3JCX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR3P3JCX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710788,"name":"Mindful Market Red Crystal Tibetan Incense Meditation Natural Hand Rolled Sticks Fair Trade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HC8GwESFL._AC_SL1182_.jpg","description":"Red Crystal Incense from India hand rolled by the Drikung Charitable Society, Kagyudpa Monastery; made using 23 of the purest Himalayan herbs and spices. Incense puts off a classic Tibetan deep and woodsy fragrance with a strong sandalwood base. The all natural sacred ingredients release their strong aromatherapy when burned, and through our sense of smell we’re able to feel its powerful healing effects. Use this medicinal incense for meditation, yoga, stress, anxiety, healing, and studying.  The preparation of traditional incense is one of the oldest medicinal practices of Tibet. Each stick is hand rolled following the ancient texts laid out in prayer books in accordance with Tibetan traditions. Kindly Note: Organic incense does not have a stick in the middle as it is purely made from 100% natural ingredients and won’t fit standard burners. If you don’t have the proper vessel, you can make one by pouring a small amount of sand/salt into a ceramic bowl/cup, lay incense on top and burn. If needed, you can easily break the sticks into smaller pieces or simply push stick into the soil of a plant. Please burn responsibly. The biggest benefit to not having a wooden stick in the center is the guarantee you are inhaling only the purest quality medicinal herbs and sacred ingredients. Authentic Tibetan incense should be handmade in a traditional monastery or medical institute if being used for its medicinal properties. Mindfully sourced through Fair Trade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HC8GwESFL._AC_SL1182_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mindful Market","source_asin":"B0746BJQN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746BJQN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746BJQN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
