window.products.push({"id":710807,"name":"Prime-Line KD 16090 Overhead Storage Rack System, 30 inch Long Tracks, Steel Construction, White, (1 set)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sNazirDbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tote Trac is an overhead garage storage system for plastic bins. It is an affordable, easy-to-use storage solution that allows you to take advantage of the unused overhead space in your garage. Use multiple sets to easily expand the system and fully declutter and organize your garage or storage space. It is recommended that you use high quality heavy duty storage bins or tubs that feature reinforced ribs under the edge rail or flange. Tools needed for installation include a stud finder, pencil or marker, drill, 5/32\" drill bit and 10mm socket with drill adapter. Lag bolts must be centered on a ceiling joist stud to ensure the Tote Trac system is installed securely. The Tote Trac system is also fully scalable. Each 2 piece set of Tote Trac in the package can support storage bins on either side, which allows for maximum customization of storage space by using multiple sets in tandem. For example, 1 set can support 2 bins, but 2 sets can support a total of six 12 gallon bins that are sized 15” x 21” (2 bins can be supported within each set and an additional 2 bins can be supported in between each of the 2 sets). This arrangement can be extended across your storage space as needed. Limit weight to a maximum of 50 pounds per tote and 25 pounds per \"J\" hook. Total weight on an individual piece of Tote Trac racking should not exceed 100 pounds (200 pounds for a set).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sNazirDbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tote Trac","source_asin":"B071S619WH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071S619WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071S619WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710808,"name":"Manual Coffee Grinder, Adjustable Ceramic Burr Grinders with Stainless Steel Adjustment Nut and Glass Jar, by HomEco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ntrQIbjaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FEATURES: INFINITELY ADJUSTABLE- Unlike some of the grinders with click settings, this coffee grinder can be adjusted by turning the grind adjustment nut to your desired coffee grind, no matter how course or fine; the perfect grinder for brewing expresso, french press, cold brew and pour over. NO BATTERIES OR POWER CORDS - With the HomEco Ceramic Coffee Mill, you are not restricted by battery life or how close you are to an outlet. This mill is operated by a simple yet effective hand crank. GRIND AND STORE - Our coffee mill comes with a storage lid for convenient storage of unused ground coffee (holds 100 grams/3.5 oz.). LONG LASTING BLADES - Ceramic burrs are made to last up to five times longer than stainless steel blades. EXTREMELY PORTABLE - Our grinder is small and lightweight, an ideal travel accessory for vacations, camping and picnicking. INSTRUCTIONS: 1. Place a tablespoon of coffee beans into the top hopper and adjust the grind level accordingly (see coffee grind adjustment instruction). 2. While holding the grinder, spin the handle clockwise to grind beans (Avoid turning the handle counter-clockwise while grinding, as this could damage the mill.). 3. Slowly add a tablespoon of beans at a time, according to the amount of coffee desired. 4. For french press, we recommend a coarser grind; for water drip coffee makers, we recommend a finer grind; for other coffee makers, a medium grind is recommended. ADJUSTMENT GUIDE: 1. Turn the locking screw counter-clockwise and remove. 2. Remove handle and stopper. 3. Turn the grind adjustment nut to the desired grind level (Turn clockwise {right} for a finer grind. Turn counter-clockwise {left} for a coarser grind.). 4. Lock adjustment nut with the stopper. 5. Install the handle and locking screw.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ntrQIbjaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomEco","source_asin":"B01MFFY91B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MFFY91B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MFFY91B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
