window.products.push({"id":710812,"name":"KeeKit Digital Pocket Scale, 200g 0.01g Mini Scale with 50g Calibration Weight, Highly Accurate Jewelry Scale with Tare, LCD Backlit Display for Food,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N2T40pFiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH PRECISION: This digital scale built-in high precision sensor system, high accuracy, smaller error, fast response and very sensitive. It provides you with instant and accurate weight readings from 0.05g to 200g, accurate to 0.01g. LCD DISPLAY: This milligram scale has large LCD display with orange backlight, clear and easy to read, even in the dark environment can also view the data. And it designed with a stainless steel platform and a protective flip cover. Auto-off after 180 seconds of inactivity, which helps to preserve battery power and efficiency. 6 DIFFERENT MEASUREMENT: The pocket scale converts measurement units between g/oz/ozt/dwt/ct/gn in a few seconds. Convenient for you to select the right unit by pressing the MODE button. In addition, there is a piece counting function, low battery alert, overload alert, and other functions. COMPACT SIZE: Pocket size is easy to store and convenient to carry, with 2 AAA batteries for power supply and 50g calibration weights. If you find any inaccuracies throughout the use of your scale, simply use the 50g calibration weight provided and recalibrate according to the calibration method, and you will continue to use your scale accurately. WIDELY APPLICATION: Mini digital scale can meet your many portable weighing needs, such as food, coins, jewelry, gold, etc. All KeeKit products are protected by our 60 Day Money Back Guarantee & 12 Month Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N2T40pFiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeeKit","source_asin":"B0BS2BBM8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS2BBM8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS2BBM8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
