window.products.push({"id":710838,"name":"Elihome LARGE Kitchen Cutting Board, Natural Wood Fiber Composite, Dishwasher Safe, Eco-Friendly, Juice Grooves with Easy Grip Handles,Non Porous, BPA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vfq70TG6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made in USA - Crafted from high-density pine leaf sustainable material and made in the USA, this fiber-wood cutting board is the ideal size for daily meal prep. This cutting board is not only eco-friendly but also durable, so it can withstand the rigors of daily use in your kitchen. Its versatile design makes it a great addition to any home cook's arsenal. Juice Groove Design - The cutting board features a juice groove design, which effectively catches flour, crumbs, liquids, and even sticky or acidic drippings, preventing them from spilling over the counter. This thoughtful feature helps to keep your kitchen clean and tidy, while also making it easier to maintain and food safety standards. Knife friendly - resist deep cut marks and protects knives. Nonporous, do not absorb odor. The cutting surface of this board is knife-friendly, as it is both non-porous and ultra-strong, ensuring that it won't damage or dull your knives during use. Not only is it gentle on cutlery, but it is also easy to clean, making meal prep a breeze. This surface can withstand the rigors of slicing and dicing, even with sharp knives, and is resistant to stains and odors, ensuring long-term use without any unwanted smells or discoloration. Solid and Durable- Crafted from solid and durable fiberwood material, this cutting board is built to last and resist warping, cracking, and other types of damage. It can withstand daily use without compromising on its quality or performance. Safe and healthy for your everyday meal preparation. NSF certified. Perfect for slicing, cutting and serving, the options are endless. Dishwasher Safe & Heat Resistant - This cutting board is both dishwasher safe and heat resistant, withstanding temperatures up to 350°F. In addition to its use as a cutting board, it can also serve as a trivet to protect your countertop from hot pots and pans. Its maintenance-free design makes it easy to clean, and it can be conveniently placed in the dishwasher for hassle-free cleaning. Heat resistant up to 350°F, and can be used as a trivet . Limited Lifetime Warranty - This cutting board comes with lifetime warranty, providing you with peace of mind and ensuring that you can enjoy this product for years to come. With this warranty, you can trust in the quality and durability of this cutting board, knowing that it is built to last. Great for household necessities and kitchen accessories. Available 3 sizes -This cutting board is available in four different sizes, including 10 inches by 7 inches(Ideal for Fruit and Cheese), 13 inches by 10 inches(Ideal for cooked food), 16 inches by 12 inches(ideal for raw food, seafood, vegetables and pastry). This range of sizes ensures that you can find the perfect fit for your kitchen and culinary needs, whether you're prepping a quick snack or cooking a large family meal. Reversible- Its reversible design with double-sided cutting board ensures that whether you're cutting veggies or meat, you can simply flip the board over and explore your endless options with both sides for different food types. Eco Friendly - Crafted from sustainable high-density pine leaf material, this fiber-wood cutting board is an eco-friendly choice for your kitchen. Its perfect size makes it ideal for daily meal preparation, whether you're chopping vegetables or meat. This versatile cutting board allows you to explore endless culinary possibilities while reducing your carbon footprint. Built-in Hole for easy storage - The board also features a convenient built-in thumb hole that makes it easy to grip, move around and easy storage, whether you're in a busy kitchen or looking for a storage solution that won't take up too much space. This cutting board is the perfect choice for anyone who wants a reliable and long-lasting tool for their food preparation needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vfq70TG6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elihome","source_asin":"B09H2BN81V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H2BN81V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H2BN81V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
