window.products.push({"id":710899,"name":"Kitchen Knives Sharpener, 2 Stages with Ceramic and Tungsten hones, Stainless Steel Handle, Non-Slip Base- Quick Sharpening for Dull Steel, Straight a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+ThBEoYgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Restore all your knives and save your bucks The construction of our sharpener is quite sturdy with nice handle for gripping and coarse (left) and fine (right) if the sharpener is held with your left hand and the knife held with your right hand. You can see inside the notch that the coarse sharpener is comprised of two steel (Tungsten) rods that are crossed in the notch and the fine with two crossed ceramic (white) rods. As you insert the blade and pull forward, you can feel the knife \"catching\" in the cross rods and the resistance/friction is felt as the blade is being sharpened. It blends with your stainless steel appliances so wouldn't mind leaving it on the counter top. How to use For the dull knives, use the coarse side. To polish the blade, use the fine side Hold the handle with one hand, and put the knife into the slot. Easy on the downward pressure and move the knife through the slot slowly in one direction(pull it towards you). 15-20 strokes on each sides will be enough. Be sure to grip the metal portion on the left-hand side securely so it doesn’t slip on your countertop while sharpening Warranty Every knife sharpener is covered a 45-day money back risk-free warranty! If you are not satisfied with your purchase. Kindly CONTACT US DIRECTLY so that we can make sure that you are taken care of right away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+ThBEoYgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Master K","source_asin":"B07H1B9B9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H1B9B9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H1B9B9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
