window.products.push({"id":710927,"name":"The Wisest Owls Hanging Mobile - 18 Inches - High Quality - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qVI5iDhoL._AC_SL1341_.jpg","description":"Owls are some of nature's wisest animals and this amusing mobile is perfect for hanging in a nursery. It is fun for the baby and also designed to be a ongoing inspiration for the child while growing up. For adults or children, this high end mobile is handmade in Denmark. It is perfectly balanced so that all elements are in constant motion. A Flensted Mobile is made from a combination of love, dedication and quality, bringing a unique design into your home while helping you to unwind at the same time. Each mobile is fully assembled, ready to hang, and requires no additional assembly except attaching the memorabilia items of your choice. Each is beautifully packaged, and makes an excellent gift. Flensted Mobiles are a traditional handicraft in Denmark. The first modern designer mobile was made there in 1954. Today Flensted Mobiles is based on the Danish island of Funen, the birthplace of Hans Christian Anderson, where it creates its very own design fairy tales from the old village school in Brenderup. We are represented all over the world, and take pride in bringing you handmade Danish design for your home - and your heart. Made of light, high quality cardboard, and measures 18\" X 18\" when displayed. Please see the product description below for more details, and a Flensted Mobile FAQ, and click the \"by Flensted Mobiles\" link below this page's product title to view all of our different styles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qVI5iDhoL._AC_SL1341_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B0019MKRGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0019MKRGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0019MKRGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
