window.products.push({"id":710946,"name":"KALAR 3 Piece Vacuum Seal Food Storage Containers Set, Airtight Food Storage Canister Set with Vacuum Pump, for Kitchen Pantry Organization","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pg3z1QgYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VACUUM SEAL: KALAR vacuum containers are not like those traditional airtight containers, which just seal the air and the food inside of the containers. Instead, KALAR vacuum containers set has an individual vacuum pump that can help to remove oxygen to keep food fresh and retain nutrients up to 5 times longer than traditional airtight containers. EASY TO USE: Step 1-Actuating the pump several times to remove the air from the container. Step 2-Pulling up the edge of the silicone valve, open the lid after hearing the sound of “hiss”. SET WITH 3 SIZES: Set comes with 3 different sized containers which includes 1 Large Container (2.0QT/ 1.9 Liters), 1 Medium Container (1.37QT/ 1.3 Liter), 1 Small Container (0.74QT/ 0.7 Liter), together with an individual pump all packed in a nice and compact color box. For your kitchen & pantry dry-storage needs or your friends as a gift. VERSATILE CONTAINERS - MANY GREAT USES: With the large capacity, these kitchen storage containers are perfect for many kinds of dry food and baking supplies, such as flour, sugar, rice, grain, chips, cereals, nuts, beans, snacks, pasta, coffee and tea. Or even you can keep stationery like erasers, pens as well as clips. VACUUM SEAL DURATION: Nothing lasts forever, when left unopned KALAR vacuum containers will keep air out for around 5-7 days, you can extend vacuum time by repeating step 1- actuating the pump several times to remove the air. NOT AFRAID OF COLD OR HIGH TEMPERATURE: This product can withstand high temperature of 212 degrees Fahrenheit and low temperature of 14 degrees Fahrenheit. It can be put into the sterilization cabinet for steam disinfection, and it can also be put into the refrigerator for cold storage in summer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pg3z1QgYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KALAR","source_asin":"B08BRJ3Z9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BRJ3Z9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BRJ3Z9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
