window.products.push({"id":710951,"name":"BALCONY&FALCON Chair Cushion Non-Slip Rear Seat Cover Plus Cushion 16x16 Inches, Cushion Cover for Office/Dining/Kitchen, Support, Sturdy and Durable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zuP+y4xtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"⭐[High Quality] Memory foam is the leading filling type, which can be used for any comfortable cushion. Whether it is pillows, mattresses, bed frames or chair cushions, as we all know, memory foam is the leader in comfort materials. Over the years, we have tried different structures, listened to your feedback, and made a soft and comfortable cushion; all chairs must have. ⭐[Super Fixed] We know that unfixed chair cushions can cause discomfort. One of the most important qualities of a chair cushion is that it can be used often and fixed in place. Belts have been used on chair cushions for decades. They are a simple but thorough way to keep the cushion on the chair. Through research and development, we have designed the best way to stick the cushion to your chair like glue (without glue)-it belongs to it. ⭐[Perfect for any chair] Sit down for years! Our chair cushion design fits all chairs. These mats are squares with rounded corners or squares with curved corners, measuring 16\" x 16\". These sizes are suitable for almost all dining rooms, living rooms, game rooms, bedrooms, and even outdoor chairs (we do not recommend putting these chair cushions outside, but you can use them on outdoor chairs and take them with you when you are done). ⭐[Good-looking and multi-purpose design] The cover of these cushions is designed with honey comb, which is very suitable for any decoration. The honeycomb pattern is a stylish and unique pattern that looks beautiful on any chair. Conveniently provide 7 colors, choose one to match your chair directly, or choose another color to decorate the chair. ⭐[Durable, long-lasting, easy to care] For us, every stitch is important. Strength and durability are built into every inch. Most importantly, these mats can be machine washed! Machine wash cold, do not bleach, do not iron, boil dry without heating, your chair cushion will look like new, sitting in a comfortable and relaxing place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zuP+y4xtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALCONY & FALCON","source_asin":"B08CGMJHSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CGMJHSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CGMJHSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
