window.products.push({"id":710974,"name":"Raguso Cocoa Powder Shaker Kitchen Craft Fine Mesh Coffee Sieve Stainless Shaker Icing Sugar Salt Cocoa Flour Sifter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RbQUvoJhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: This shaker is perfect for sprinkling chocolate, cinnamon, nutmeg, or for making Latte Art. It help you uniformly and quickly shake out sugar, sprinkles, cocoa, powdered spices and icing sugar. Give your drinks a more attractive look! Also can be used for decorating cakes, cupcakes, etc. Features: Safe material: food grade 304 stainless steel material can contact with food directly.  ABS dust-proof cover blocks the moisture in the air, keep rest of powder dry and fresh. Fine mesh, used to sprinkle evenly the coffee with coco powder or coffee powder to enhance flavor. Very easy to be cleaned by water and always keep as bright as the new after getting dry completely. Perfect for sprinkling cocoa and chocolate, making Latte Art, or decorating cappuccinos cakes cupcakes, baking, etc. Specification: Condition: 100% Brand New Material: 304 Stainless Steel Color: Silver Mesh Diameter: Approx. 4.8cm / 1.9inch Product Size: Approx. 6 x 7.8cm / 2.4 x 3.1inch Package Weight: Approx. 114g Package Included: 1 x Chocolate Shaker Note: 1. After cleaning, please keep it dry. To prolong the lifespan of the product, there is no need to clean it every time, just take the dry powder off. After each use, you have to dry it with a hairdryer, otherwise it will rust. 2. Please allow 1-2 cm error due to manual measurement and make sure you do not mind before ordering. 3. Please understand that colors may exist chromatic aberration as the different placement of pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RbQUvoJhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raguso","source_asin":"B08T983JLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T983JLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T983JLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":710975,"name":"SINGER Izek with Automatic Needle Threader","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XRS9ZQ09L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Collectable, great condition, has some yellowing of the plastic frame on top. see all photos , includes yellow Gameboy and accessories, does not include gameboy sewing instruction cartridge. All sales final 100% of proceeds provides free clothing and toys to foster children through Foster Care Support Foundation Amazon.com From its translucent-blue bubble to its sleek curves, this high-tech sewing machine is \"sew\" totally cool! It attracts hordes of hip devotees who have never even taken a home-ec sewing class. That's because it's computerized, combining with a Nintendo Game Boy to convert what was once grandma's chore into a fun activity for any family member. Embroidering jeans, customizing shirts with fancy stitching, monogramming napkins, creating zingy buttonholes--all this and much, much more is a snap with the Izek. It automatically sews 84 stitch patterns (and up to three combinations), five buttonhole styles, letters (block, script, or outline format), numbers, and symbols and allows hobbyists and artists to create--and save in the Game Boy memory--their own stitch patterns, letters, and designs. When the Game Boy is turned on, music plays and the screen permits a choice of English, French, or Spanish. Next comes a choice of patterns, buttonholes, letters, favorites, custom, and colors. Then single or combination patterns. The 84 stitch patterns show up, each adjustable for length and width. A selected pattern can be added to favorites or sent to the sewing machine. A choice of viewing the machine's setup guide follows. Turning down that option prepares the machine to sew the stitch pattern as it's been selected and customized. Of course, the machine functions without the Game Boy wizardry, and it's loaded with convenient features: automatic needle threader, one-step buttonhole sewing, electronic speed control, front drop-in bobbin for easy viewing and changing, needle up/needle down function, free-arm sewing, and many others. A complete accessory package (various presser feet, friction-free spool holders, transparent bobbins, and needles for sewing different fabrics) is included. Invaluable is Singer's illustrated, step-by-step instruction booklet. The machine is under warranty for 25 years against mechanical defects, 2 years against electrical defects, and 90 days for adjustments. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XRS9ZQ09L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SINGER","source_asin":"B00005NWQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-710975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005NWQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005NWQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
